<i>The rising new star of this island</i>

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:37.080
<i>Everyone's chiming in to just say</i>

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.200
<i>Now, get on your feet, dauntlessly</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.500
<i>Once you grab the microphone, naturally</i>

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:43.330
<i>We're going to go wild, so check it out</i>

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:45.690
<i>For tonight, the very best dinner</i>

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.660
<i>Words going beyond even the color of skin</i>

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:51.290
<i>This universal vibration</i>

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:53.070
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:55.580
<i>You gonna feel so</i>

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:58.780
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:04.410
<i>Before the time comes
when there's no turning back</i>

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:07.250
<i>Let's turn things in a positive direction</i>

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:13.830
<i>If you don't take action,
you won't get anywhere</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:18.160
<i>Never gonna stop, never gonna stop</i>

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:20.510
<i>The feeling of love is happiness</i>

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:22.540
<i>You were not in pain, you were not in pain</i>

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:24.700
<i>Because we fall in love, there's sadness</i>

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:26.910
<i>Never gonna stop, never gonna stop</i>

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:29.040
<i>The feeling of love is happiness</i>

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:31.250
<i>You were not in pain, you were not in pain</i>

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:34.910
<i>Because we fall in love, there's sadness</i>

00:01:34.910 --> 00:01:36.950
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.250
<i>You gonna feel so</i>

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:41.250
<i>Yeah, come on!</i>

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:51.080
Chapter 7 Suzu

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:12.480
Hey, Tatsu!

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:14.910
Was it cheaper over here at this shop?

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:17.210
Who cares about any of that?

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:18.620
Let's see, the tea comes to a total of 32 <i>mon</i>.

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:22.080
Can I go on back ahead of you?

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:24.280
The seaweed is 20 <i>mon</i>. And the yams...

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:24.280
I'm talking to you, Tatsu!

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:27.120
Oh, shut up!
You're messing up my calculations!

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:29.620
We're not poor anymore!

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:33.040
Who cares if you buy the expensive stuff?!
It's not our money anyway!

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:34.660
You know, Tetsu,

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:37.580
how can you say that kind of
thing to me? I'm a bookkeeper.

00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:40.720
Money should be spent carefully,
no matter how much you have!

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:42.470
Cheapskate.

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:44.950
It's in the Strictures of the
Shinsengumi too, remember?!

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:47.470
Wasting money or getting into
debt is punishable by seppuku!

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:50.510
I get it already. I just have
to wait for you, right?

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:54.400
That reminds me...

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.080
Bizenya

00:02:57.330 --> 00:02:58.700
<i>Swords?</i>

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:07.830
Oh-ho...

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:11.000
It has no maker's mark,
but it is quite a fine sword.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:15.340
It has some peculiarities,
but its sharpness is certified.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.910
<i>Now, this is more like it.</i>

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:22.830
<i>I want a sword or two...</i>

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:25.660
The price would be four <i>ryo</i>.

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:26.750
<i>Expensive!</i>

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:28.660
It's a great value.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:30.950
Yes, that's reasonable.

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:32.410
<i>For real?!</i>

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:34.440
<i>No, wait...</i>

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:41.400
<i>A full-sized sword might not be possible,
but maybe I could manage a short sword...</i>

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:47.620
<i>This guy looks familiar.</i>

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:50.660
You're more interested in a
short sword than a normal sword?

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:51.950
You're an odd one.

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:53.460
What?! You're also...

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:56.590
Something wrong with that?

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:57.820
Not really.

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:00.920
Let go.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.420
You let go.

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:05.550
Don't be ridiculous!
This would be wasted on you!

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:06.600
What?!

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:09.450
If you're gonna say that, this sword
of yours had better be really good!

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:11.290
Hey, what are you doing, you damn brat?!

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:13.500
Lemme see it, damn it!
Quit it, you bastard!

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:14.270
Lemme see it!

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:16.020
Let go!

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:24.160
Never forget that you are my page.

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:26.240
Mind your conduct.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:30.040
If you want to look at it, go ahead.

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:33.080
It's not something a brat can draw anyway.

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:37.790
What are you...?

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:43.670
What the hell is this?!

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:48.140
Like I told you. Your puny
arms could never draw...

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:51.390
Oh, I see. This is how you use it.

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:54.040
Sorry to disturb you when you're so busy,

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:56.270
but you're interfering with
our business, you whelps.

00:04:56.580 --> 00:04:58.060
You get out of my way, you whelp!

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:01.280
<i>You </i>get out of the way, you whelp!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:03.490
Move it, you runts!

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.240
Who're you calling a runt?

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:17.670
Don't group me together
with that brat there!

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:21.380
<i>He did a quick draw with that sword?</i>

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:24.170
<i>He's an unbelievable bastard.</i>

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:30.050
Master Nakayama...

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:33.750
What's this, a fight?

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:35.930
It's little ones again.

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:37.910
Tetsu...

00:05:37.910 --> 00:05:39.360
Don't tell me...

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:42.940
Just...

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:44.270
Just sit there!

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:48.490
I'll use you to test this sword!

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:50.620
Not my problem.

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:52.950
You take care of this somehow
with that sword of yours.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.450
<i>Now I've gone and done it.</i>

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:59.120
<i>If I draw attention to myself in Kyoto,
it'll only be a burden to my master!</i>

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:02.460
<i>Stupid, stupid, stupid! I'm an idiot!</i>

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:07.300
I humbly ask that you forgive them!

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:12.500
A child's squabble it may have been, but
such violence as to cut apart your sleeve!

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:16.120
I am well aware that having one
such as I humbly ask for forgiveness

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:17.980
is hardly enough to calm your rage!

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:22.000
However, we brothers just arrived
in the capital the other day

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.290
and are but simple country
folk with no manners.

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:26.620
They are merely children, who know
not their right from their left!

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:29.740
No, these two may as well be babes!

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:31.830
How dare you just...?

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:35.240
Being just children who know no manners
or common sense or discretion,

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:38.000
I have repeatedly instructed
them along the way,

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:41.330
but what has occurred here is
entirely due to my negligence!

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.500
As it is my responsibility,

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:47.830
taking the heads of these two
children would only sully your sword!

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:51.890
Please, please take my head in their stead!

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:54.370
This sure is turning into a big deal.

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:56.830
Those poor children.

00:06:56.830 --> 00:07:01.040
He's apologizing so hard;
just forgive him already.

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:03.870
Oh, just shut up!

00:07:03.870 --> 00:07:07.790
There, there, Master Nakayama,
please calm yourself.

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:12.370
My body is being wracked by disease, and my
life is such that I may not see tomorrow.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.250
If I were to die here and now,

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:17.580
I am sure my younger brothers
would be rendered homeless

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:19.500
and would be swallowed
up by the storm of life,

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.370
but come! Before your anger abates!

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:24.130
Please do not hesitate! One clean cut!

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:26.660
That hurts, Tatsu!

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:29.250
What're you doing suddenly
showing up and groveling?!

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:32.540
Stay quiet! This is all
your doing again anyway!

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:35.220
No, it's not! It wasn't me, it was him!

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:36.860
He's the one who did it!

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:39.370
Why are you always getting into fights?!

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:41.620
Listen to what I've got to say, Tatsu!

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:44.100
No! I don't have to hear it
to know that it's your fault!

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:47.080
Tatsu, you're heavy! Get this hand off me!

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:49.040
No, you're staying where you are!

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:50.410
Shall I go get the officials?

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:53.580
Yeah, hurry! That samurai's serious!

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:57.000
Oh, no, that's... No, well...

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:00.330
Damn it, I'm in no mood
for this! I'm going home!

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.770
Out of my way!

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:10.010
Sorry about that. Thanks for coming.

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:13.500
You there, I'm sorry that you
got tangled up in this mess.

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:16.580
I told you, you've got it wrong!
He's the one who started...

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:18.100
Hey, where do you think you're going?!

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:21.430
You started this whole thing! Hey!

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:24.080
Hey!
Tetsu!

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:26.810
You slant-eyed goblin cat!

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:31.440
What's with him?!

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:41.250
♪ Maru, Take, Ebisu, Ni, Oshi, Oike ♪

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:46.450
♪ Ane, San, Rokkaku, Tako, Nishiki ♪

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:49.310
♪ Shi, Aya, Buttaka, Matsu... ♪

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:56.580
It's rare for you to take
it so easy, Miss Ayumu.

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:58.000
I suppose.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:02.910
And the two stray bullets I sent out
shopping still haven't come back.

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:05.960
Well...

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:11.620
The weather's great, don't you think?

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:14.600
If only days like this
would continue on forever.

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:25.120
What good is such a timid attitude?!

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:26.950
If we're afraid of those Wolves of Mibu,

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:29.590
we of the Choshu Clan
will never get our revenge!

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:33.910
But if we rush into things,
they'll only bear down on us harder!

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:37.500
We should wait for the right time,
just as Master Katsura says!

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:41.100
As it is, some of our comrades
were cut down just recently!

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:44.040
That is why now is the time!

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:47.540
Look! Our comrades are
gathering in the capital in droves!

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:49.870
If it were me, while you
blathered on about such things,

00:09:49.870 --> 00:09:53.280
I would have chopped off
an Aizu head or two!

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:58.040
That would undermine Master Katsura's position
as the representative of the Choshu Clan!

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:01.000
Why don't you think
things through a little?!

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:04.330
A political debate in the Master's absence?

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:09.770
That man apparently has a
marked dislike of festivals.

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:18.590
You men are not reconsidering, I hope.

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:22.200
There is only one reason for
which we came to the capital.

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:24.390
To correct the direction in
which this country is headed.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:25.520
Master Yoshida!

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:28.120
Debate is not needed for a revolution.

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:30.450
If there are those who would blunt
the sword of the exclusionists,

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:33.070
let's have them atone for
it with their blood.

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:04.620
My other skill may have improved,
but this has a long way to go.

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:07.930
Pardon me.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:14.860
What are you doing?

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:17.660
Well, if it isn't Toshi! What is it?

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:23.390
Oh, this. I thought I should
polish my skills once in a while.

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:28.620
Good work on your trip
to Osaka the other day.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:33.040
I received a word of appreciation
from Lord Matsudaira.

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.380
I heard all that already.

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:39.300
What's the matter, Toshi?
Something troubling you?

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:43.720
I heard you held a footrace at
Mibu Temple while I was gone.

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:45.500
Oh, that!

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:47.160
Really, that was a lot of fun!

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:49.890
A great martial arts competition
with all our members!

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:54.350
Sano's spear work was incredible,

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:57.150
but more than anything, Sannan's
clever scheme left me speechless!

00:11:58.610 --> 00:12:00.860
Who would've thought?
First place with his abaci!

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:05.870
I hadn't seen Sannan having
so much fun in a long time.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:10.330
No, it wasn't like we did it
because you weren't around!

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:12.300
How fine that must have been for you.

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:17.460
Toshi, this isn't like you.
What are you mad about?

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:20.410
The Shinsengumi isn't
about friends and games.

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:22.420
Don't do things that'll loosen their guard.

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:31.430
Don't be so impatient, Toshi.

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:35.160
We've come this far, haven't we?

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:38.700
One hundred twenty <i>ri
</i>from the fields of Bushu...

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:42.160
Oh, Mr. Harada, what are you doing?

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:45.360
Sano, you moron! Don't eat
it with the shell still on it!

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:51.580
Master Kondo, what do you
think about going to the capital?

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:57.150
The day we left Koishikawa
was February 8th.

00:12:58.450 --> 00:13:00.370
It's been a year since then.

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:06.650
Now, we're forty respectable
samurai under the Aizu Clan.

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:07.510
Under the Authority of Higo no
Kami Matsudaira Shinsengumi

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:10.290
Toshi, do you remember?

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:13.710
When we entered the Yagi
Residence as the Shinsengumi?

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:19.680
Soji was all excited, like a kid.
He seemed so happy.

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:25.450
I have never once forgotten
our aspirations.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.220
I am prepared to give my life
whenever it is necessary.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.000
Isn't that right, Toshi?

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:41.040
Yeah.

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:51.840
Master...

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:53.470
Master?

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:57.480
Oh, did you hear? There's a new teahouse.

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:55.770
What is it?

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.270
No, nothing.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:14:01.270
Really? Take me there too.

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:04.190
Thank you kindly.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:05.400
Pardon us.

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:09.200
You're very kind, Master.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:17.250
But sometimes, I become uncertain.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:19.450
The Master who killed
those comrades of ours,

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:21.620
or the usual Master, who is so quiet.

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:25.040
Which one is the real Master?

00:14:25.040 --> 00:14:27.150
Do not think of unnecessary things.

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:34.350
Oh, it's just a cat.

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:45.790
Were you to ponder which was your
real self, it would blunt your sword.

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:47.870
You are still young.

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:54.000
Though my body may rot away
in the fields of Musashi,

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:57.120
my Yamato soul desires to stay on.

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:01.830
That is a poem by Master Shoin,
who died in the Ansei Purge.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:07.820
My mission is to pursue the will of my
master and to accomplish the revolution.

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:11.640
Suzu, if I fall, you must take up my cause.

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:12.760
Master!

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:15.540
Worried?

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:18.040
Then work diligently by my side.

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:21.940
By the by, have you found
a good short sword?

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:25.110
No.

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:29.330
Next time, I will come with
you to find a good sword.

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:30.360
Yes, Sir!

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:34.200
♪ Crouch down, crouch down ♪

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:37.870
♪ The bird inside the cage ♪

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:41.580
♪ When, oh when will it get out? ♪...

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:41.580
Today's shopping came out to be really cheap!

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:43.210
You just have to look for the deals.

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:45.370
♪ On a night of dawn ♪

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:45.370
Sheesh! Think about how I feel

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:47.020
having to keep you company!

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:48.710
♪ The crane and turtle slipped ♪

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:52.220
♪ Who is the person behind you? ♪

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:56.550
Come on, let's play
sword-fighting! This is boring!

00:15:56.790 --> 00:16:00.250
I don't want to! Sojiro is playing with me!

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:03.900
Sojiro, piggyback ride!
Mr. Okita!

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:06.230
Mr. Okita!

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:07.730
Hi there, Tetsu.

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:10.700
What are you doing here?

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:12.750
Let's play sword-fighting!

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:13.750
What? Me?

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:16.160
Hurry up and get off, or Sojiro
won't be able to play with us.

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:19.740
Don't wanna, I want a piggyback ride!

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:22.410
There now, you're troubling
your older sister.

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.250
Heavenly punishment!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:26.250
That hurt! You...

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:27.090
Yay!

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.000
Come on, teach me sword fighting!

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:34.180
All Sojiro does is laugh,
and he won't teach me anything!

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:39.180
I know! Show me your sword!

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:41.620
Just a little won't hurt, right? Come on!

00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:43.600
I want to see it too!

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:44.350
Wanna see!

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:47.620
What a cheapskate.

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:50.660
Or don't you have a sword,
even though you're with them?

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:51.860
Don't you have one?

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:54.040
I...

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:58.030
Tetsu!

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:07.210
<i>Or don't you have a sword,
even though you're with them?</i>

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:13.630
Vice Commander!

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:15.880
What?! You're making such a racket.

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:18.910
I want my own sword!

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:21.080
Please take my request into consideration!

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:22.430
No!

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:23.790
Why not?!

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:26.200
I'm a member of the Shinsengumi too!

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:28.700
I can't fight if I'm not armed!

00:17:31.120 --> 00:17:33.330
I know I still have a lot to learn!

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:36.450
I'll practice more and work diligently!

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:39.120
Vice Commander!

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:41.910
No means no.

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:44.080
Besides, what do you think you're saying

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:46.620
when you can't even carry out the
duties of a page to satisfaction?

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:49.830
Is a page not allowed to carry a sword?!

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:52.050
Who decided that?!

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:58.550
Mr. Hijikata, would you mind
keeping me company for a bit?

00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:01.070
Vice Commander!

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:10.040
A bag of those candies.

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:11.020
Oh, and this.

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:15.030
Please buy this too.

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:24.500
You should also have some,
Mr. Hijikata. They're delicious.

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:26.660
Like hell I'm touching that
stuff; it's for brats.

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:31.700
Oh, you shouldn't say that.
Kyoto sweets are works of art.

00:18:31.700 --> 00:18:34.300
Or would you have preferred pickled radish?

00:18:34.870 --> 00:18:37.200
So, what did you want to talk about?

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:41.590
You didn't drag me all the way out
here just to get sweets, did you?

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:43.040
You're so mean.

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:46.270
You were in a tight spot,
so I brought you out here.

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:52.940
Why won't you let Tetsu have a sword?

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:57.880
Why won't you let him make the choice?

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:01.610
It's absurd. He's just a brat of fifteen.

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:03.280
I was nine.

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:08.190
I was nine years old.

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:25.970
So, that's it, isn't it?

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:30.390
You'd rather not make the same
mistake that you did with me.

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:32.600
Soji...

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:54.710
<i>Four tonight?</i>

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:02.010
Ten-pointed Fuka throwing stars?!

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:04.000
The Fuma?!

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:14.520
How disappointing.

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:19.530
I was wondering what kind of expert
you were, but you're only a boy.

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:21.450
If you get in over your
head with your antics,

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:22.780
you'll pay for it!

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:50.310
Did you think you could get away?

00:21:21.870 --> 00:21:24.670
Vulgar peeping will only get you hurt.

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:46.740
Go back and tell the Shogunate's hounds.

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:07.910
<i>Gripping the microphone tight,
the hit parade's on parade</i>

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:11.450
<i>Hey, Jimmy, how you feeling?</i>

00:22:11.450 --> 00:22:15.790
<i>Quite the gentleman when he's off stage</i>

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:19.480
<i>Hey, Jimmy, a generous spirit too!</i>

00:22:19.480 --> 00:22:23.440
<i>Being such an honest guy,
even his life's plain</i>

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:27.290
<i>Keep building it up patiently</i>

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:31.290
<i>May your dreams come true honestly</i>

00:22:31.290 --> 00:22:35.120
<i>Let's go for it again today, Jimmy</i>

00:22:37.160 --> 00:22:40.660
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:40.660 --> 00:22:44.550
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:22:44.550 --> 00:22:48.500
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:22:48.500 --> 00:22:52.640
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

