00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:20.040
<i>You got to fight for your money!
How you feeling, Jimmy?</i>

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:24.330
<i>You got to fight for your dream,
it's all too much</i>

00:23:25.750 --> 00:23:28.050
Next Peacemaker Kurogane

00:23:27.040 --> 00:23:31.630
<i>Tetsu, I'm
just really, really worried about you.</i>

00:23:31.630 --> 00:23:34.350
<i>Are you still thinking
about getting a sword?</i>

00:23:34.350 --> 00:23:37.390
